{"id":"n73252-1-7","stage":1,"title":"휴일 · 休息日","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73252-1-7-1","ko":"우리 다음주 월요일에 소풍 갈까? 휴일이잖아.","zh":"我们下周一去野餐怎么样？那天是假日啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"다음주","meaning":"下面，下一个；周，星期","explanation":"다음：下面，下一个；주：周，星期。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"},{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"1","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"46811","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음주","audio":"/audio/1472617f82f6157d89cf.mp3"}},{"text":"월요일에","meaning":"星期一，周一，礼拜一","explanation":"월요일：星期一，周一，礼拜一；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"월요일","audio":"/audio/6c95540e90f1a66864be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70069","senseId":"1","lemma":"월요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"월요일에","audio":"/audio/9a88d3499861b5534224.mp3"}},{"text":"소풍","meaning":"远足，郊游，野游","explanation":"소풍：远足，郊游，野游。","readings":[{"term":"소풍","audio":"/audio/687c92f20434bf39a11f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26854","senseId":"1","lemma":"소풍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소풍","audio":"/audio/687c92f20434bf39a11f.mp3"}},{"text":"갈까?","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈까","audio":"/audio/0e3718549837ff797d8c.mp3"}},{"text":"휴일이잖아.","meaning":"休息日，公休日，假日","explanation":"휴일：休息日，公休日，假日；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"휴일","audio":"/audio/98c4721ccd1350f17224.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73252","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴일이잖아","audio":"/audio/4c25a010da091fe1e596.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"下面，下一个","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"某个次序的后一个。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"6234d5b178a8b258","term":"주","zh":"周，星期","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3","entryId":"46811","definition":"从周一至周日七天为一周期计算的时间单位。","pronunciation":["주"]},{"id":"6c95540e90f1a668","term":"월요일","zh":"星期一，周一，礼拜一","audio":"/audio/6c95540e90f1a66864be.mp3","entryId":"70069","definition":"一个星期开始的第一天。","pronunciation":["워료일"]},{"id":"687c92f20434bf39","term":"소풍","zh":"远足，郊游，野游","audio":"/audio/687c92f20434bf39a11f.mp3","entryId":"26854","definition":"为了享受美景或做游戏而去野外。","pronunciation":["소풍"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"98c4721ccd1350f1","term":"휴일","zh":"休息日，公休日，假日","audio":"/audio/98c4721ccd1350f17224.mp3","entryId":"73252","definition":"如周日或法定假日等不工作、休息的日子。","pronunciation":["휴일"]}],"audio":"/audio/9183cb38361334927fd8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73252-1-7-2","ko":"나는 집에서 늦잠이나 실컷 잘래. 너무 피곤해.","zh":"我打算在家多睡一会儿，实在太累了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"집에서","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에서","audio":"/audio/c00afeb6cadab90f0098.mp3"}},{"text":"늦잠이나","meaning":"懒觉","explanation":"늦잠：懒觉；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"늦잠","audio":"/audio/4dc69297f0f60b6cd02e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41393","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦잠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦잠이나","audio":"/audio/e7207a567c7a64cb6544.mp3"}},{"text":"실컷","meaning":"尽情，充分","explanation":"실컷：尽情，充分。","readings":[{"term":"실컷","audio":"/audio/5f58ab67054aac9b5043.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14126","senseId":"1","lemma":"실컷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"실컷","audio":"/audio/5f58ab67054aac9b5043.mp3"}},{"text":"잘래.","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；ㄹ래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘래","audio":"/audio/05c53c180dea3f4e4369.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"피곤해.","meaning":"疲倦，疲惫，困","explanation":"피곤하다：疲倦，疲惫，困；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"피곤하다","audio":"/audio/69e26389ae2a6e2f50d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60291","senseId":"1","lemma":"피곤하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"피곤해","audio":"/audio/658f643097f32b8076bb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"4dc69297f0f60b6c","term":"늦잠","zh":"懒觉","audio":"/audio/4dc69297f0f60b6cd02e.mp3","entryId":"41393","definition":"早上睡到很晚的觉。","pronunciation":["늗짬"]},{"id":"5f58ab67054aac9b","term":"실컷","zh":"尽情，充分","audio":"/audio/5f58ab67054aac9b5043.mp3","entryId":"14126","definition":"想做什么就做什么。","pronunciation":["실컫"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"69e26389ae2a6e2f","term":"피곤하다","zh":"疲倦，疲惫，困","audio":"/audio/69e26389ae2a6e2f50d8.mp3","entryId":"60291","definition":"身体或心里觉得累而筋疲力尽。","pronunciation":["피곤하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e74174db43042cf41cef.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.713,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73252","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":52,"sequenceScore":2.2651,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我们下周一去野餐怎么样？那天是假日啊。","我打算在家多睡一会儿，实在太累了。","你没看到放在桌子下面的笔记本吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我们下周一去野餐怎么样？那天是假日啊。","我打算在家多睡一会儿，实在太累了。","你没看到放在桌子下面的笔记本吗？"],"answer":1}]}
